•
Receipt of the natural gas made available by the shipper at the receipt
point (within the restrictions stipulated in the contract);
•
Return/redelivery of the natural gas made available by the shipper at
the receipt point at the delivery point considering the restrictions and
rules applicable at such point (inter alia quality parameters);
•
Management and steering of the pipeline (system) and operate and
maintain the pipeline and ancillary facilities
•
Other services such as:
– measurement (including metering the quantity and analyzing and metering
the quality of the natural gas at the receipt and delivery point);
– receipt and confirmation of (re-)nominations;
– data management, collection and transfer;
– allocation and attribution of quantities (to various shippers);
– evaluation of measurements;
– documentation;
– billing.
